        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Aubergine absorbs oil greedily. Salt the cubes and pat dry before cooking to reduce how much oil they drink. A very hot wok also helps them colour without becoming greasy." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
      },
