            {
              "symptom": "Aubergine is greasy and heavy.",
              "cause": "It was not salted and dried before frying.",
              "fix": "Salt, rest and pat dry before the aubergine hits the wok."
            },
            {
              "symptom": "Dish is far too salty.",
              "cause": "Doubanjiang is already very salty on top of the soy sauce.",
